## What you get

- **One object per part**, no I/O until `Initialize()`. See [API guide](api-guide.md).
- **Errors you can act on**: `Result<T>` with an `Error`. See [Contract](contract.md).
- **Zero-overhead portability**: a CRTP port checked by a concept. See [Porting](porting.md).
- **Tested without hardware** against a model of the pins. See [Testing and CI](testing.md).
